Google's AI Overview appeared for 188 of 393 usable queries (47.8%) in a locked 399-query UK panel across 10 sectors, pulled from Ahrefs's GB SERP data on 25 September 2026. Presence ranged from 31.0% in automotive to 82.4% in insurance. Brand/company domains account for 241 of 394 resolved citation rows (61.2%) in a 100-query stratified citation sample, more than any other source type.

## How often do AI Overviews appear, by UK sector? {% #presence-by-sector %}

Each sector's queries come from 5 distinct seed topics, for example mortgage, credit card, savings account, pension and ISA for Finance/Banking. The last column shows the largest share of a sector's queries supplied by any one seed; the [method](#method) explains how it is counted.

| Sector | Usable queries | AI Overview present | Presence rate | Max share assigned to one source seed |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Insurance | 34 | 28 | 82.4% | 23.5% |
| Finance/Banking | 47 | 30 | 63.8% | 21.3% |
| Legal | 35 | 19 | 54.3% | 28.6% |
| Travel/Tourism | 40 | 21 | 52.5% | 24.4% |
| Home Improvement/Trades | 46 | 20 | 43.5% | 21.7% |
| Retail/Ecommerce | 40 | 16 | 40.0% | 23.8% |
| Health/NHS | 37 | 14 | 37.8% | 26.3% |
| Education | 40 | 15 | 37.5% | 23.8% |
| Food/Restaurants | 32 | 12 | 37.5% | 31.2% |
| Automotive | 42 | 13 | 31.0% | 23.8% |
| **All sectors** | **393** | **188** | **47.8%** | **21.3% to 31.2%** |

