Of 399 panel queries, 393 (98.5%) returned usable feature data. The remaining 6 (1.5%) returned an empty feature array with no other evidence and were treated as missing, not as confirmed absence of an AI Overview. Every panel query clears a predeclared minimum recorded UK search volume of 100 a month.

